Node ID=10 Start Sermon
Text=...there is hope! You must turn your backs away from wickedness and embrace *truth*, accept salvation, and *believe* in the Inquisition.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=10 Sermon Banter 1
Text=Though your flesh is corrupt and the taint of magic burns in your blood, your *soul* can be saved!
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=10 Sermon Banter 1b
Text=Listen to the words of the Lord, let the Inquisition show you the light!
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=10 Sermon Banter 2
Text=<Ahem>
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=10 Sermon Banter 3
Text=As I was saying, resist the call of magic, purge yourself of the taint of sorcery and allow the Inquisition to save your souls!
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=10 Sermon Banter 4
Text=...Though I walk through the valley of the shadow of death, I will fear no evil, for Thou art with me.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=10 Random Crowd Banter 1
Text=Bless *me*, Inquisitor!
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=10 Random Crowd Banter 2
Text=Save us, your holiness!
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=10 Random Crowd Banter 3
Text=If you wish to save us, why do you keep us penned in the port? 
